{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-belgravia-heights-1","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"belgravia-heights-ellington-properties-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Belgravia Heights 1 is a 21-storey residential building located in the Jumeirah Village Circle neighborhood developed by Ellington Properties.Belgravia Heights 1 consists of 15 residential floors and a six-story podium.With a total of 155 units, the development offers studios and apartments with one and two-bedroom floor plans. The apartments include master and guest bedrooms with built-in closets, bathrooms with modern amenities, a furnished living room, a fully equipped kitchen and a spacious dining area. The properties also have cozy balconies that offer beautiful views of the surrounding area.On-site amenities include a garage, gym and barbecue area, as well as swimming pools for children and adults. The complex has a rooftop terrace with a green garden and yoga studio.There are several supermarkets in the neighborhood such as Blue Mart, Spinneys Supermarket and JAM JAM, which are within walking distance of the complex, and many restaurants including Burger Live, Pide Keyfi and Desert Wok Restaurant.The neighborhood in which the complex is located is close to two major highways, Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Northern Bijada Boulevard, which provide residents with easy access to other parts of the city. Residents can quickly access several nearby public transportation stops, including buses, streetcars and metro.","price":1350000,"title":"Belgravia Heights 1","bitrix":{"id":786,"pf_id":"are.2.9871","source":null,"project_id":"Belgravia Heights 1","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Belgravia Heights 1","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Ellington Properties","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2523/images/2024/07/1